OL,3,ASchools to close early for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crash happened near South Bank on
OL,7,F22 August when a Volkswagen Passat
OL,8,Ftravelled the wrong way on the dual
OL,9,Fcarriageway and hit a police car. Two
OL,10,Fpolice officers, PC Matthew Blades, 37,
OL,11,Fand PC Tom Clough, 38, were also
OL,12,Fkilled.
OL,14,FHead teachers warned parents large
OL,15,Fcrowds were expected to gather in the
OL,16,FSouth Bank area for the funeral, with
OL,17,Ftraffic disruption likely.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
